<style>
  @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap");

  .tax-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--tg-body-font-family);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .tax-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }
  }
  .tax-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tax-container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
  }
  .tax-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tax-subtitle {
    color: var(--tg-primary-color);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .tax-title {
    font-family: var(--tg-heading-font-family);
    color: var(--tg-heading-font-color);
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tax-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }
  .tax-desc {
    color: var(--tg-paragraph-color);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.625;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tax-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tax-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .tax-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e1e4eb;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .tax-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px -8px rgba(24, 32, 78, 0.15);
  }

  .tax-icon-wrapper {
    width: 4rem;
    height: 4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(114, 82, 127, 0.1);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;
  }
  .tax-icon {
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--tg-primary-color);
  }

  .tax-card-title {
    font-family: var(--tg-heading-font-family);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--tg-heading-font-color);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .tax-card-text {
    color: var(--tg-paragraph-color);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.625;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tax-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .tax-footer-text {
    color: var(--tg-paragraph-color);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .tax-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: var(--tg-primary-color);
    color: var(--tg-heading-font-color);
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tax-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--tg-primary-color); /* gold-light */
  }
</style>

<section class="tax-section">
  <div class="tax-container">
    <div class="tax-header">
      <span class="tax-subtitle">Tax Advantages</span>
      <h2 class="tax-title">Income Tax Benefits for ZCZP Investors</h2>
      <p class="tax-desc">
        One of the strongest reasons to use Social Stock Exchange instruments
        instead of informal donations is the structured way Income Tax and
        reporting work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tax-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="tax-card">
        <div class="tax-icon-wrapper">
          <svg
            class="tax-icon"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path
              d="M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z"
            ></path><path d="M16 8h-6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8"
            ></path><path d="M12 17.5v-11"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tax-card-title">Section 80G Deduction</h3>
        <p class="tax-card-text">
          Investments in ZCZP instruments issued by eligible NPOs on the SSE are
          treated as eligible donations under Section 80G of the Income Tax Act.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="tax-card">
        <div class="tax-icon-wrapper">
          <svg
            class="tax-icon"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"
            ></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"
            ></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tax-card-title">Standardised Tax Route</h3>
        <p class="tax-card-text">
          Instead of multiple donation receipts from different NGOs, you receive
          documentation that clearly establishes your ZCZP contribution and 80G
          eligibility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="tax-card">
        <div class="tax-icon-wrapper">
          <svg
            class="tax-icon"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path
              d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"
            ></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tax-card-title">Important Caveat</h3>
        <p class="tax-card-text">
          Subscribers of ZCZP instruments generally do not receive any other
          Income Tax benefit beyond the Section 80G deduction on the eligible
          amount.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tax-footer">
      <p class="tax-footer-text">
        For corporate investors, SEBI's push for social sector bonds strengthens
        the case for using SSE as part of a CSR or social finance strategy.
      </p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/918141155525" class="tax-btn" target="_blank">
        Check Your 80G Eligibility
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
